"Use a full WSS endpoint, or WS on localhost for development. Do not put credentials in the URL." = "請使用完整的 WSS 接口地址，本機開發可使用 WS。不要在地址中放入憑據。";
"Use a nonempty single-line term, strength 0–100, and an optional language code such as zh-CN or en-US. Each field can contain up to 30,000 characters and each term up to 50 aliases." = "詞條不能為空且必須為單行，強度範圍為 0–100。語言代碼可留空，例如 zh-CN 或 en-US。每個字段最多 30,000 個字符，每個詞條最多 50 個別名。";
"Use a sync passphrase of at least 12 characters (up to 1024 bytes)." = "同步口令至少需要 12 個字符，最多 1024 字節。";
"Use model endpoint" = "使用模型接口地址";
"Use the same three values on each device. The passphrase is never sent to the server; losing it means the server copy cannot be recovered." = "各設備使用相同的這三項配置。口令不會發送到服務器；丟失後將無法恢復服務器上的副本。";
"Use the server's sync access token (at least 32 characters)." = "請使用服務器的同步訪問令牌，至少 32 個字符。";
"View" = "顯示";
"Vocabulary" = "詞庫";
